msgstr "Cantidad de decimales a la que se redondean los puntajes. Ejemplo: '2' permite 98.76."

msgid "The number of tokens that a contestant has available for this task when their contest time starts.\n                                    It is used only if tokens are finite."
msgstr "Fichas de este problema que un concursante tiene al empezar su concurso. Solo se usa si las fichas son finitas."

msgid "The number of tokens that are generated periodically for this task.\n                                    It is used only if tokens are finite."
